# Grid Table Persona Rules

This folder contains the active Grid Table persona split by concern.

- `identity.mdc` - maintainer role and priorities.
- `structure.mdc` - file/folder naming and component structure.
- `code-style.mdc` - constants, types, hooks, aliases, and TSX rules.
- `review-checklist.mdc` - mandatory code review checks and build gates.

Use these rules together for all `grid-table` and `grid-table/portal` changes.
